---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import TicketCard from '../components/TicketCard.astro';
---
<Layout title="The Lineup">
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 w-full mt-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl text-white font-display mb-8">Set Times</h1>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="p-6 border-l-4 border-zinc-500 bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md rounded-sm shadow-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display text-white uppercase tracking-widest">The Venue</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 mt-2 text-lg">
          Baltimore Soundstage<br />
          124 Market Pl<br />
          Baltimore, MD 21202
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 border-l-4 border-zinc-500 bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md rounded-sm shadow-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Dress Code</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 mt-2 text-lg italic">All-Black Minimalist Casual Attire.</p>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 mt-2">
          Calm, cool & collected. Wear what will keep you on the dance floor all night. Streetwear, band tees & sneakers encouraged.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mt-2 italic">
          *Pit-safe footwear recommended.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl my-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 px-6 py-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-dashed border-zinc-700">
        <span class="text-center text-pink-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rotate-0 sm:-rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap">
          Trent & Shy<br /><br />Baltimore<br />Soundstage<br /><br />Oct 10, 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-white mb-1">Doors Open</h3>
        <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">4:00 PM - The Lobby</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Find your spot in the crowd. The main act starts soon.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl my-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 px-6 py-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-dashed border-zinc-700">
        <span class="text-center text-pink-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rotate-0 sm:-rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap">
          Trent & Shy<br /><br />Baltimore<br />Soundstage<br /><br />Oct 10, 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-white mb-1">Last Chance To Dance</h3>
        <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">4:20 PM - Main Stage</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Doors for the ceremony close promptly at 4:20 (Bouncer Enforced).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl my-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 px-6 py-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-dashed border-zinc-700">
        <span class="text-center text-pink-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rotate-0 sm:-rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap">
          Trent & Shy<br /><br />Baltimore<br />Soundstage<br /><br />Oct 10, 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-white mb-1">Ceremony</h3>
        <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">4:30 PM - Main Stage</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>The Main Act. Short, sweet, and heavy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl my-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 px-6 py-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-dashed border-zinc-700">
        <span class="text-center text-pink-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rotate-0 sm:-rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap">
          Trent & Shy<br /><br />Baltimore<br />Soundstage<br /><br />Oct 10, 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-white mb-1">Dinner</h3>
        <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">5:00 PM - The Pit</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Fuel up. Food and drinks (first 2 rounds on us) will be served as we clear the floor for the real party.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl my-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 px-6 py-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-dashed border-zinc-700">
        <span class="text-center text-pink-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rotate-0 sm:-rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap">
          Trent & Shy<br /><br />Baltimore<br />Soundstage<br /><br />Oct 10, 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-white mb-1">Last Call</h3>
        <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">Til the cows come home</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>A very loud playlist, endless moshing, and celebrating until they literally kick us out. Bring your earplugs if you're sensitive to punching music—we’re turning it up to eleven.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>